@startuml
title Certificate Key Rotation Flow

actor EventBridge
participant "Key-Rotation-Lambda" as Lambda
participant "AWS KMS" as KMS
database "S3 Bucket" as S3
participant "CKMSAPI" as CKMS

== Scheduled Trigger ==

EventBridge -> Lambda : Trigger every 330 days\n(customerId, keyAlgorithm)

== Key Pair Generation ==

Lambda -> KMS : Generate RSA Key Pair

== CSR Creation ==

Lambda -> Lambda : Create CSR file with CN including customerId

== Certificate Existence Check ==

Lambda -> CKMS : Check if certificate exists (CN)

alt Certificate does not exist
    Lambda -> CKMS : Add new certificate (CSR)
else Certificate exists
    Lambda -> CKMS : Renew certificate (CSR)
end

== Certificate Fetch and Save ==

Lambda -> CKMS : Fetch latest certificate info (CN)
Lambda -> S3 : Save certificate details

@enduml
